  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultant, Advisory and Logistics Services (CALS) - Photographer/Videographer</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Servicios de Consultor&#xed;a, Asesoramiento y Log&#xed;stica (CALS) - Fot&#xf3;grafo/Vide&#xf3;grafo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El contrato de Servicios de Consultor&#xed;a, Asesor&#xed;a y Log&#xed;stica (CALS) apoya las actividades y los objetivos de desarrollo de USAID/Colombias brindando servicios de consultor&#xed;a y asesor&#xed;a; evaluaciones, valoraciones y an&#xe1;lisis; y talleres, conferencias y eventos; servicios de log&#xed;stica y cadena de suministro; y otros servicios. Esta Orden de Trabajo brinda servicios de producci&#xf3;n de fotograf&#xed;a y video para mostrar el impacto del trabajo de ayuda exterior a trav&#xe9;s de historias visuales centradas en lo humano que incorporan ensayos fotogr&#xe1;ficos, narrativas en video y gr&#xe1;ficos que ilustran c&#xf3;mo USAID y sus socios est&#xe1;n trabajando para lograr una Colombia m&#xe1;s estable, pac&#xed;fica y pr&#xf3;spera a trav&#xe9;s de una gobernanza inclusiva y un crecimiento equitativo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Consultant, Advisory and Logistics Services (CALS) contract support USAID/Colombias activities and development objectives by providing consultant and advisory services; evaluations, assessments, and analyses; and workshops, conferences, and events; logistics and supply chain services; and other services. This Task Order provides Photography and Video production services to showcase the impact of foreign aid work through visual, human-centric stories that incorporate photo essays, video narratives, and graphics that illustrate how USAID and its partners are working to achieve a more stable, peaceful, and prosperous Colombia through inclusive governance and equitable growth.</narrative>
  </description>
